### scorpio context broker - Temporal operation

GET http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/temporal/entities/urn:energy-meter:LOAD10000000001?temporalValues=true&timerel=between&timeAt=2024-10-01T00:00:00Z&endTimeAt=2025-10-20T23:59:59Z&attrs=activeFeed,reactiveFeed HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/ld+json
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <http://context-hoster/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.8.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"
NGSILD-Tenant: smartcity
NGSILD-Path: /


